aconte sa propre histoire avec humour "},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795350000","title":": Coupe du monde a Gurgl","released":"2026-11-22T12:20:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T12:20:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T13:30:00Z","runtime":"70 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795354200","title":"Moto GP : Grand Prix du Portugal","released":"2026-11-22T13:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T13:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T14:10:00Z","runtime":"40 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795356600","title":": Grand Prix de Las Vegas","released":"2026-11-22T14:10:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T14:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T16:25:00Z","runtime":"135 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795364700","title":"RTS Info","released":"2026-11-22T16:25:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T16:25:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T17:00:00Z","runtime":"35 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795366800","title":"Forum","released":"2026-11-22T17:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T17:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T18:05:00Z","runtime":"65 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795370700","title":"RTS Info","released":"2026-11-22T18:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T18:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T18:30:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795372200","title":"19h30 signé","released":"2026-11-22T18:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T18:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T19:05:00Z","runtime":"35 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795374300","title":"PMU","released":"2026-11-22T19:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T19:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T19:10:00Z","runtime":"5 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795374600","title":"Les Simpson 30","released":"2026-11-22T19:10:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T19:10:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T19:35:00Z","runtime":"25 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795376100","title":"Les Simpson 30","released":"2026-11-22T19:35:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T19:35:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T19:55:00Z","runtime":"20 min","description":"Les Simpsons se rendent aux chutes du Niagara. Alors qu'elle joue avec son frere, Bart, Lisa bascule accidentellement par-dessus bord. Elle est alors secourue par un gendarme canadien et emmenée a l'hôpital, ou elle est gardée en observation. Méfiante envers la politique américaine, Lisa se voit accorder, par erreur, l'asile politique au Canada. Elle est donc placée dans un foyer d'accueil, tandis que le reste de sa famille retourne a Springfield. Mais Marge met en place un plan pour que la famille récupere Lisa.."},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795377300","title":"La stratégie du tapis de bombes","released":"2026-11-22T19:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T19:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T20:40:00Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795380000","title":"La stratégie du tapis de bombes","released":"2026-11-22T20:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T20:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T21:35:00Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795383300","title":"Tous les buts","released":"2026-11-22T21:35:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T21:35:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T21:55:00Z","runtime":"20 min"},{"id":"kepg_pl_ad4f148134f598b4ad2d5aaa_epg_1795384500","title":"Against the Tide : A contre-courant","released":"2026-11-22T21:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-22T21:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-22T23:30:00Z","runtime":"95 min","description":"Rakesh Koli et Ganesh Nakhawa, deux amis pecheurs travaillant dans le port de Mumbai, sont poussés au désespoir par une mer qui se meurt. Leur amitié commence a se briser alors qu'ils empruntent des chemins tres différents pour subvenir aux besoins de leurs familles en difficulté. Rakesh, meme s'il a du mal a joindre les deux bouts, entend s'en tenir a la peche traditionnelle qu'il a apprise de son pere, une méthode respectueuse des ressources de la mer. Ganesh, lui, est séduit par une nouvelle approche 